Activity-1

A promotional poster designed using Canva featuring a free coffee offer. This activity applies the basic principles of effective presentation design, including visual hierarchy, readability, color combinations, typography, spacing, and layout.

What Have I Learned?

Through this activity, I learned how important design principles are in creating an effective promotional material. I realized that choosing the right colors, fonts, and layout helps make a design more attractive and easier to understand. I also learned how Canva makes it possible to create a design in just a few steps, while still requiring creativity and attention to detail.
